    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "Figure 1-1 illustrates the integer portion of the user programming model. It consists of the following registers:",
      "bbox": [
        262,
        317,
        2263,
        445
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0038_seg_004"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "- 16 General-Purpose 32-Bit Registers (D7 – D0, A7 – A0)\n- 32-Bit Program Counter (PC)\n- 8-Bit Condition Code Register (CCR)",
      "bbox": [
